A recorded canvas history for the phase 8 demo (issue 804).

000001 to 000008 are the canvas files the real blitter (src/016-blitter.lua)
wrote while taking every round of the phase 1 series (src/018-phase-1-series.lua):
a 40x6 canvas, three voices, the kitten, the dog and the windy day, with
word and sentence marks aging out. They are exactly what canvas/history
holds on kuvalu, so the viewers read them as they read the live canvas.

issues/completed/demos/phase-8-demo replays them, one each second, into
its own throwaway canvas folder while the three viewers watch.
issues/completed/demos/phase-8-record.lua made them, and makes them again:

    luajit issues/completed/demos/phase-8-record.lua . assets/phase-8-history

Only the written: lines change from one recording to the next.
